---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of Service for using the Tangata website and its online services.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="article-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Terms</div>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="article-body">
    <p><strong>Last updated: 19 October 2026</strong></p>

    <p>These Terms of Service apply to the use of the Tangata website and its online services.</p>

    <h2>About Tangata</h2>
    <p>Tangata provides counselling and EMDR therapy services in the United Kingdom. Information provided on this website is for general information about Tangata and its services and is not a substitute for individual medical, psychological or emergency advice.</p>

    <h2>Using this website</h2>
    <p>You may use this website for lawful purposes and to obtain information about Tangata's services or contact Tangata.</p>
    <p>You must not knowingly misuse the website, attempt to gain unauthorised access to it or its associated systems, introduce malicious software, or use the website in a way that could interfere with its operation.</p>

    <h2>Therapy services</h2>
    <p>Any counselling or EMDR therapy provided by Tangata is subject to the arrangements, consent, confidentiality, fees, cancellation terms and other information agreed with the individual client.</p>
    <p>Viewing this website, submitting an enquiry or using an online form does not by itself create a therapist-client relationship.</p>

    <h2>Online accounts and third-party services</h2>
    <p>Tangata may use third-party services to support its administration and provision of services, including services for appointments, forms, communications, document management or other business functions.</p>
    <p>Where a third-party service is used, its own terms and privacy arrangements may also apply.</p>

    <h2>Website information</h2>
    <p>Tangata aims to keep information on this website accurate and up to date but cannot guarantee that all information will always be complete, current or free from error.</p>
    <p>The website may contain links to external websites. Tangata is not responsible for the content, availability or privacy practices of external websites.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Unless otherwise stated, the text, branding and original content on this website belong to Tangata and may not be reproduced for commercial purposes without permission.</p>

    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>Tangata does not guarantee that the website or any particular online service will always be available. Access may occasionally be interrupted for maintenance, technical reasons or circumstances outside Tangata's control.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>These terms may be updated occasionally. The current version will always be published on this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about these terms, please contact Tangata using the contact details provided on this website.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
